#* {{quote-journal|en|year=1962|month=October|title=Talking of Trains: New signalbox at Twyford|journal=Modern Railways|page=226|text=The Henley branch, recently '''singled''' and fully track-circuited, is worked by acceptance lever between Twyford and Shiplake cabins.}}
